- `entity_id` required FBID. See `catalog://id-conventions` via resources/read.
- `name` optional substring, `limit` default 20 max 100, `cursor` — see `catalog://pagination` via resources/read.

## Shared resources
- `catalog://id-conventions` via resources/read
